Motivation
we have some code that works in eager & scripting mode, but need a different codepath in tracing mode to handle dynamic shapes.
Workaround: this works, at the cost of duplicating the eager/scripting codeblock:
       if torch.jit.is_scripting():
            return x + 1
        else:
            if not torch.jit.is_tracing():
                return x + 1
            else:
                return x + 2
